  "description": "City pop fused funk, boogie, jazz-fusion and yacht rock into the soundtrack of Japan's bubble prosperity — Tatsuro Yamashita, Mariya Takeuchi, Miki Matsubara — with album art of shining skylines, Mercedes dashes and poolside leisure. Rediscovered via YouTube algorithms (\"Plastic Love\", \"Mayonaka no Door\") in 2017-2020, its aesthetics feed future funk, vaporwave samples and the global image of retro-Tokyo night drives.",
